{"abstract":"In this paper, we tackle the Aerial Vision-and-Dialog Navigation (AVDN) task in the training-free setting for resource-efficient high-altitude UAV navigation.Naively applying MLLMs leads to unreliable navigation due to weak directional grounding and the lack of explicit spatial memory.To address these issues, we propose PSC-AVDN, a training-free framework that tightly couples a three-stage Parsing-Search-Confirmation reasoning pipeline with a Structured Spatial Memory (SSM).The parsing stage uses an LLM to convert ambiguous dialogue instructions into stable geometric directional and destination cues.A Search Chain-of-Thought (S-CoT) then performs stepwise target exploration under high-altitude observations, and a Confirmation Chain-of-Thought (C-CoT) conducts fine-grained verification around candidate regions to resolve visual ambiguity.Meanwhile, SSM integrates three complementary sources of spatial cues, including multi-scale visual observation, spatial visual memory, and structured geometric memory to provide global spatial context and long-horizon consistency.Extensive experiments on ANDH and ANDH-Full show that PSC-AVDN establishes new state-of-the-art performance in the training-free setting, matching or surpassing several finetuned methods.Code will be publicly available at: https://github.com/QY6616/PSC-AVDN","affiliations":[],"arxiv_id":"2607.11529","authors":["Yu Qi","Hongyu Li","Shaofei Huang","Tianrui Hui","Yaxiong Wang","Lechao Cheng","Zhun Zhong","Si Liu","Meng Wang"],"availability":{"basis":"arxiv_public_full_text","checked_at":"2026-08-15T16:04:35+00:00","full_text_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.11529.pdf","license":"arxiv-distribution","page_count":10,"pdf_bytes":2800504,"status":"available"},"citation_count":null,"content_digest":"5fdd701cd51510bb55352d4595e279f58073193a19aef63ef691290561b2d8c4","created_at":"2026-08-15T16:04:35+00:00","doi":"","identifier_observations":[],"institutions":[],"landing_url":"","legacy_ids":[],"migration_provenance":{"source_content_digest":"e4bc0672848abd9478296bcc845c14cd1e63a50999924a3d8a463958b8f89440","source_schema_version":"global-work-v1"},"openalex_id":"","pmcid":"","pmid":"","publication_date":"","revision":1,"schema_version":"global-work-v2","semantic_scholar_id":"","source_urls":[],"status":"active","title":"Parse, Search, and Confirmation: Training-Free Aerial Vision-and-Dialog Navigation with Chain-of-Thought Reasoning and Structured Spatial Memory","updated_at":"2026-08-15T16:04:35+00:00","venue":"arXiv","work_id":"W-EDA2FB3EC09E","year":2026}
